    "npm_advisory_id": null,
    "overview": "extract-zip through 2.0.1 containment-checks only the parent directory of each archive entry and never the entry's own final path component, so an archive containing two entries with identical names - a symlink whose target is outside the destination, followed by a regular file - writes through the planted symlink and yields an arbitrary file write outside the destination directory.",
    "reported_by": null,
    "title": "extract-zip allows arbitrary file writes through symlink archive entries",
